{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493730/extras/about_this_game_en-US1.png?t=1746548428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MULTIPLAYER COUCH CO-OP ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raise your spear! Pierce your enemies! Go on expeditions with up to 6 player marshmallows to rekindle your sacred campfire in this hunters\u2019 ritual</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SANDBOX OVERWORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated map for every run, clear your own path to retrieve the sacred flames. expanding your influence on the map unlocks more events, levels and dungeons to choose next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SIMPLE CONTROLS, HECTIC GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use spears to pierce and push your way to glory, weave through the flames and traps while using them to your advantage, clearing obstacles and foes together amid the mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HUNTERS LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and change your appearance throughout your journey, one-up your friends through impressive combat feats and cement your legacy in stone at the end of each expedition, unlocking more enemies, tools and locations for the hunters that come after</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493730/extras/about_this_game_en-US2.png?t=1746548428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left Joystick : movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Right Joystick : shoot (aim/release)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Right Trigger \uff1ashoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Square Button : use tool</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">option/menu\uff1aremove controller</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/34